==History==
2024
*The Goblin Machine was added to the game on 17/6/2024, in the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]].
*On 19/6/2024, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (19/6/2024)|maintenance break]], decreased the rocket’s damage by 33.5%, increased the rocket’s attack time interval to 4 seconds (from 3.5 seconds), and made it so that the Rocket would only deal 50% of its full damage to [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Towers]].
*On 2/7/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Machine’s hitpoints by 15.5%, and increased its first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.2 seconds).
*On 6/8/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/8/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the rocket's attack time interval to 3.5 seconds (from 4 seconds).
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Machine's hitpoints by 5%.
*On 30/10/2024, the [[Version History#Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update (30/10/2024)|Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Goblin Machine from Scrap Yard to Miner's Mine.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Machine's damage by 57% and increased its attack time interval to 1.2 seconds (from 0.9 seconds).
*On 30/1/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (30/1/2025)|maintenance break]], made it so that [[Rune Giant]]'s damage boost would no longer affect the Goblin Machine's rocket.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Machine's hitpoints by 7% and decreased its rocket's damage by 22%.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Goblin Machine's rocket hit speed to 5 seconds (from 3.5 seconds), increased the rocket speed by 40%, increased the melee damage by 9%, and increased his hitpoints by 5%

